  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_FrTp_00154\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> FrTp_TriggerTransmit <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_FrTp_00154\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_FrTp_00154]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_FlexRayISOTransportLayer.pdf#nameddest=SWS_FrTp_00154\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_FlexRayISOTransportLayer.pdf (Anker: #SWS_FrTp_00154, S. 83)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> FrTp_TriggerTransmit (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> TxPduId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>* PduInfoPtr);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Within this API , the upper layer module (called module) shall check whether the available data fits into the buffer size reported by Pdu Info Ptr - >Sdu Length. If it fits, it shall copy its data into the buffer provided by Pdu Info Ptr - >Sdu Data Ptr and update the length of the actual copied data in Pdu Info Ptr - >Sdu Length. If not, it returns E_ NOT_ OK without changing Pdu Info Ptr.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
